            "type": "game",
            "name": "Charlie's Adventure",
            "steam_appid": 556870,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/556870/extras/4b8012a82734d216d0fc9969c1cc3702.avif?t=1790780224\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/556870/extras_big/4b8012a82734d216d0fc9969c1cc3702.avif?t=1790780224 width=1560 height=730 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Charlie and enter a strange world overrun by hordes of zombies, deadly traps, and unexpected dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a series of platforming challenges, eliminate waves of undead enemies, and use the environment to your advantage. Master a variety of skills and abilities as you help Charlie cleanse his world of the zombie infestation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of zombie enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly traps that can eliminate both you and your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment as part of your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, difficult to master gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable key bindings for keyboard, mouse, and joystick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for Ultra HD (4K) resolution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help Charlie survive the nightmare and rid his world of the undead.</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/556870/extras/4b8012a82734d216d0fc9969c1cc3702.avif?t=1790780224\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/556870/extras_big/4b8012a82734d216d0fc9969c1cc3702.avif?t=1790780224 width=1560 height=730 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Charlie and enter a strange world overrun by hordes of zombies, deadly traps, and unexpected dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a series of platforming challenges, eliminate waves of undead enemies, and use the environment to your advantage. Master a variety of skills and abilities as you help Charlie cleanse his world of the zombie infestation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of zombie enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly traps that can eliminate both you and your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment as part of your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, difficult to master gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable key bindings for keyboard, mouse, and joystick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for Ultra HD (4K) resolution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help Charlie survive the nightmare and rid his world of the undead.</strong></p>",
